@startuml sesion-jwt-peer
title Sesión JWT del Peer

participant "Peer\n(wg-auto-register)" as P
participant "wg-auto.json\n(state)" as State
participant "Orchestrator\n/auth.*" as Orch

P -> State : load_state()
State --> P : {jwt, jwt_expires_at}

alt JWT existe y no expira en <60s
    P --> P : usar JWT cacheado
else JWT expira o no existe
    alt JWT existe pero expira
        P -> Orch : auth.refresh(jwt, TTL)
        Orch --> P : {jwt, expires_at}
    else JWT no existe
        P -> Orch : auth.login(user_id, peer_id, ORCH_TOKEN, scopes, TTL)
        Orch --> P : {jwt, expires_at}
    end
    P -> State : save {jwt, jwt_expires_at}
end

P --> P : retornar JWT para RPC

note over P
  **JWT_TTL**: 600s (default)
  **Refresh**: 60s antes de expirar
  **ORCH_TOKEN**: token del tenant (no del peer)
end note

@enduml
